SUMMARY:Into the Woods at NWCT
DESCRIPTION:Experience one of musical theater’s most iconic shows\, performed by the talented members of Catalyst: NWCT’s Youth Company. With timeless songs like “Children Will Listen\,” “No One Is Alone\,” and “Agony\,” Into the Woods weaves together beloved fairy tale characters in a fast-paced journey full of humor\, heart\, and surprising twists \nInto the Woods is presented through special arrangement with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance materials are also supplied by MTI. \nMusic and Lyrics by Stephen Sondheim\nBook by James Lapine\nOriginally Directed on Broadway by James Lapine\nOrchestrations by Jonathan Tunick\nDirected by Dustin Brown \nMost enjoyed by ages 8 & up. Showtimes at 11 am and 3:30 pm. Youth $10; Adults $15. \nEstimated run time: 2.5 hours with a 15 minute intermission
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/into-the-woods-at-nwct/2026-05-23/
LOCATION:The Judy\, 1000 SW Broadway\, T-100\, Portland\, OR
CATEGORIES:Indoor,Kids Calendar,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/into-the-woods-nwct.jpg
END:VEVENT
