DESCRIPTION:Make plans for CityFair at the Rose Festival\, May 22 through June 7 on the waterfront. Enjoy fair foods\, live entertainment\, carnival rides\, local crafters\, and more. All this fun takes place at beautiful Governor Tom McCall Waterfront Park\, in downtown Portland! \nCityFair spans three full weekends\, with plenty to do each time you visit.
